L52mZvrQ&oe=69BE9887"}, "display_name": "Archery VR", "keywords": ["Archery", "Shooter", "Simulation", "Birds", "Arcade"], "long_description": "**Overview**\n\nArchery VR is a focused arcade shooter designed to demonstrate high-fidelity VR mechanics. Step into an immersive environment and test your marksmanship against dynamic, fast-moving avian targets.\n\n**Key Features**\n* **Physics-Based Archery:** satisfying and realistic bow handling tailored for the Meta Quest 3 controllers.\n* **Bird Hunting:** Track and shoot down birds with precision timing. The harder the shot, the more satisfying the hit.\n* **High Score Challenge:** A pure gameplay loop focused on skill improvement and beating your personal best.\n* **Immersive Environment:** Clean visuals and responsive audio feedback create a satisfying shooting experience.\n\n**About This Project**\nThis game serves as a portfolio piece demonstrating proficiency in Unity VR development and C# scripting. It highlights the use of the Meta XR Interaction SDK to create smooth, responsive player interactions.", "short_description": "A fast-paced VR archery simulation. Master realistic bow mechanics to shoot down flying birds and compete for the highest score. Features satisfying physics, precision aiming. Created as a technical portfolio showcase for immersive VR interactions on Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/archeryvr/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AlanSalam", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/archeryvr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEM